X-Postfix-Sender: rfc822; hello@trynxeon.com
Arrival-Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 04:00:00 +0000

Final-Recipient: rfc822; jane@dead-company.com
Original-Recipient: rfc822; jane@dead-company.com
Action: failed
Status: 5.1.1
Diagnostic-Code: smtp; 550 5.1.1 <jane@dead-company.com>: Recipient address rejected: User unknown

--AAA
Content-Type: message/rfc822

From: hello@trynxeon.com
To: jane@dead-company.com
Subject: quick question

body
--AAA--
`;

const exchangeSoftBounce = `From: Microsoft Outlook <postmaster@contoso.com>
To: hello@trynxeon.com
