Your message wasn't delivered to bob@contoso.com because the remote server is
temporarily or permanently unavailable. Try resending, or the mailbox may be
over quota.

--BBB
Content-Type: message/delivery-status

Reporting-MTA: dns;contoso-DAG.contoso.com
Final-Recipient: rfc822;bob@contoso.com
Action: failed
Status: 4.2.2
Diagnostic-Code: smtp;452 4.2.2 mailbox full

--BBB--
`;

const gmailStyleBounce = `From: Mail Delivery Subsystem <mailer-daemon@googlemail.com>
To: hello@trynxeon.com
Subject: Delivery Status Notification (Failure)
